2026-07-27T10:52:03.8219503Z i /tmp/RtmpefDY4E/duckdb
2026-07-27T10:52:03.8219815Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T10:52:03.8220209Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T10:52:03.8220546Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T10:52:03.8221044Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T10:52:03.8221859Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T10:52:03.8223172Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
